---
title: "initialize (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_params: validate bidToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry != address(0)
    q_validate_params --> q_validate_refund: validate refundPeriodSeconds > 0 and <= 2 weeks
    q_validate_refund --> q_set_addresses: set bidToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry
    q_set_addresses --> q_set_fees: set legionFee, referrerFee bps values (capital and tokens)
    q_set_fees --> q_set_refund: set refundPeriodSeconds
    q_set_refund --> [*]: emit Initialized

    note right of q_validate_refund
        INV-001: refundPeriodSeconds between 1 hour and 2 weeks
        INV-002: no predetermined sale end time at initialization
        INV-003: askToken set later during publishTgeDetails
    end note
